{"id":"wb-8-437","name":"镇远天后宫","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"天后宫 (镇远县)","text":"天后宫坐落在中华人民共和国贵州省黔东南苗族侗族自治州镇远县新中街，背倚石屏山，南临㵲阳河。在中国大陆内陆地区，只有湖南省芷江侗族自治县、贵州省镇远县和黄平州有天后宫。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%A4%A9%E5%90%8E%E5%AE%AB_(%E9%95%87%E8%BF%9C%E5%8E%BF)","revisionId":86718068,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86718068","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/e649c664b581ac285a2a7d46.jpg","title":"Shanmen,_Mazu_Temple,_Zhenyuan_County.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Shanmen,_Mazu_Temple,_Zhenyuan_County.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4e/Shanmen%2C_Mazu_Temple%2C_Zhenyuan_County.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Huangdan2060","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"​贵州省镇远县㵲阳镇天后宫的山门。","width":320,"height":240}}